# Institutional Research Evidence & Empirical Findings

## Executive Summary
This document reports the empirical evidence generated by the FinPulse-Apex quantitative research engine across real market datasets (Liquid US ETFs and Binance crypto pairs). All metrics are directly resolved from the cryptographically hashed ledger without manual modification or retrospective tuning.

## 1. Real-Data Strategy Performance Across Development & Validation Splits

The pre-registered protocol evaluated candidate models across six strategy families on the historical development split (`dev`: 2005-2019 for equities, 2017-2021 for crypto) and audited them on the held-out validation split (`val`: 2020-2022 for equities, 2022-2023 for crypto).

