### Validation Split Evaluation & Survival Rule
Under the pre-registered protocol rule, a candidate survives validation only if:
1. Development Deflated Sharpe Ratio (DSR) >= 0.90
2. Validation Net Sharpe > 0.0
3. Validation Probabilistic Sharpe Ratio against Zero (PSR) >= 0.90

| Strategy Family | Val Net Sharpe | Val PSR (0) | Val PSR (Baseline) | Dev DSR | Survives Protocol |
